{"meta":{"id":"color-position","category":"it/syntax/css/style","title":"색상 · position · hover · CSS","subtitle":"(CSS)","summary":"color · background-color · opacity, position 5가지, hover cursor","tags":["css"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>CSS</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">색상 · position · hover · CSS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> color · background-color · opacity, position 5가지, hover cursor</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">색상 · 투명도</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">css</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">.box {\r\n  color: red;               /* 글자색 */\r\n  background-color: aqua;   /* 배경색 */\r\n  opacity: 0.9;             /* 투명도 (0 ~ 1) */\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">position</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기준</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">특징</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>static</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">-</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기본값, 문서 흐름대로</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>relative</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">원래 자리</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">top/left 만큼 이동, 자리는 그대로 차지 — absolute 의 기준이 됨</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>absolute</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가장 가까운 relative(또는 position 이 있는) 부모</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">흐름에서 빠져 고정 좌표에 배치</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>fixed</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">화면(viewport)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">스크롤해도 같은 위치 (상단 메뉴, 맨 위로 버튼)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>sticky</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">스크롤 영역</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">평소엔 relative, 지정 위치에 닿으면 fixed 처럼 붙음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">마우스 동작</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">css</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">.card:hover {          /* 마우스가 닿으면 */\r\n  cursor: pointer;     /* 손가락 모양 */\r\n  transform: scale(1.02);\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> jQuery › css 수정, 프로그램 언어 › CSS · SCSS › SCSS 미디어 쿼리</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/css/style/color-position","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"css","title":"CSS","path":"it/syntax/css"},{"id":"style","title":"스타일","path":"it/syntax/css/style"}],"hasImage":false}